## Architecture

Layered (Controller → Service → Repository → Model) architecture on top of Rails API.

```
app/
  controllers/
    api/
      {{#each modules}}
      {{snakeCase this}}s_controller.rb  # request handling, param whitelisting
      {{/each}}
  services/
    {{#each modules}}
    {{snakeCase this}}_service.rb        # business logic, validation
    {{/each}}
  repositories/
    {{#each modules}}
    {{snakeCase this}}_repository.rb     # data access, queries
    {{/each}}
  models/
    {{#each modules}}
    {{snakeCase this}}.rb                # ActiveRecord model
    {{/each}}
```
